  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for corporate social responsibility and local governance programs for women and youth in Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enda ECOPOP is a Senegalese nonprofit organization that develops an alternative approach to local development based on the mobilization and promotion of initiatives carried out by local authorities and grassroots groups in terms of improving living conditions and environment. With this grant, Enda ECOPOP will improve inclusive and sustainable local governance in the regions of Kolda, K&#xe9;dougou, and Tambacounda, by  strengthening citizen participation and engagement processes for women, youth, people with disabilities, and their organizations. (Strategy: Inclusive Governance)</narrative>
  </description>
